  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-steelblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Spell Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/60/FFVI_PC_Warring_Triad.png/revision/latest?cb=20170904131915\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"FFVI PC Warring Triad\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/60/FFVI_PC_Warring_Triad.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170904131915\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/60/FFVI_PC_Warring_Triad.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170904131915 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/60/FFVI_PC_Warring_Triad.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1031?cb=20170904131915 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"FFVI PC Warring Triad\" width=\"270\" height=\"180\" data-image-key=\"FFVI_PC_Warring_Triad.png\" data-image-name=\"FFVI PC Warring Triad.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Warring Triad (Final Fantasy) can absorb the effects of any spell cast in their presence.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb spells.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb spells and utilize them in some ways</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Casting\" title=\"Spell Casting\">Spell Casting</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Magical version of <a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Absorption\" title=\"Formula Absorption\">Formula Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Magic\" title=\"Absorption Magic\">Absorption Magic</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb effects of spells and/or spells themselves, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Empowerment\" title=\"Spell Empowerment\">Spell Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Resistance\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Elemental Resistance</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Immunity\" title=\"Elemental Immunity\">Elemental Immunity</a> - by absorbing elemental spells.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Durability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Durability\">Enhanced Durability</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Invulnerability\">Invulnerability</a> - by absorbing spells that do physical damage.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Negation\" title=\"Spell Negation\">Spell Negation</a> - only to spells cast on the user.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Teleportation_Negation\" title=\"Teleportation Negation\">Teleportation Negation</a> - by absorbing spells that are meant to teleport the user to another location.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Immunity\" title=\"Magic Immunity\">Magic Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Negation\" title=\"Magic Negation\">Magic Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>Spells that can cause <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">instant death</a> may still be able to get through the users' defense, if they are not totally immune.</li>\n<li>May include <a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">Healing</a> spells.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Michael_Morningstar_(Classic)\">Michael Morningstar/Darkstar</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Gwen_Tennyson_(Classic)\">Gwen Tennyson</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Addwaitya\">Addwaitya</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Charmcaster_(Classic)\">Charmcaster</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Hex_(Classic)\">Hex</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>The Dovahkiin (Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim); via Spell Absorption</li>\n<li>The Warring Triad (<i>Final Fantasy</i>)</li>\n<li>Squall Leonhart (<i>Final Fantasy VIII</i>)</li>\n<li>Quistis Trepe (<i>Final Fantasy VIII</i>)</li>\n<li>Spellfire Wielders (<i>Forgotten Realms</i>)\n<ul><li>Shandril Shessair (<i>Forgotten Realms</i>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Siphoners/Vampire-Witches (<i>The Vampire Diaries</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a>\n<ul><li>The Heretics</li>\n<li>Kai Parker</li>\n<li>Josie and Lizzie Saltzman</li></ul></li>\n<li>Touta Konoe (<i>UQ Holder</i>)</li>\n<li>Derfflinger (<i>Zero no Tsukaima</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpell_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bellanax (<i>Arkwell Academy</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" hr